\section{Task structure}{

The generated \link{TaskFcst} has the target \code{y} and the order column \code{time}, a regular index starting at \code{start} with
step \code{freq}.
A calendar \code{freq} such as \code{"month"} yields dates, a numeric \code{freq} yields the integers \verb{1, ..., n} with \code{freq} as
